PROJECT SETUP & MIGRATION GUIDE
==============================

I. PREREQUISITES
----------------
- Python 3.8+
- MySQL Server (XAMPP/WAMP/Native)
- Modern Web Browser

II. BACKEND CONFIGURATION
-------------------------
1. Folder: /backend
2. Action: Install dependencies
   Command: pip install -r requirements.txt
3. File: .env
   Action: Update DB_HOST, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD to match your local system.

III. DATABASE SETUP (MYSQL)
---------------------------
1. Ensure MySQL service is running.
2. Command (from /backend folder):
   python -m app.seed
3. This creates 'skillgap_db' and populates 15 IT categories and skills.

IV. RUNNING THE SYSTEM
----------------------
1. Start Backend:
   uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
2. Start Frontend:
   Open /index.html in any browser.

V. TROUBLESHOOTING
------------------
- If "Access Denied" for MySQL, update .env with correct credentials.
- Ensure the Backend is running before clicking "Analyze" on the Dashboard.

---
End of Document.
